 an be an active form of resistance and resilience in the face of oppressio
 n. This was on display all over the country as the blue tsunami took hold 
 and flipped the country.\n\nLet's celebrate America's political defiance w
 ith a night of radical joy in The RAD\n\nages 18+\ndoors at 6:30pm\, show 
