SUMMARY:Rooftop Comedy featuring Sarah Love
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best l
 ocal and touring comedians to Asheville! This week we have local favorite 
 Sarah Love on the rooftop at Antidote!\n\nChemist Spirts welcomes top come
 dians for a night of laughs. Enjoy a stunning AVL sunset from the rooftop 
 bar at Antidote while giggling and sipping a classic cocktail.\n\nSarah Lo
 ve is a comedian based in Asheville\, North Carolina. Her comedy is wry\, 
 silly\, provocative\, yet relatable. She has performed all over the Southe
 ast and beyond including the Comedy Zone Charlotte\, Laughing Skull in Atl
 anta\, Rodney's in New York City\, Zanies Lab in Nashville\, and Asheville
 's top venues like The Grey Eagle\, The Orange Peel and Eulogy. She’s sh
 ared the stage with Joe List\, Geoffrey Asmus\, and fan favorite Amber Aut
 ry\n\ndoors at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\nages 21+\nTickets $15
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-comedy-fans/events/31740736
 1/
